$\forall x$: Triangular\_Part\_of\_the\_Inferior\_Frontal\_Gyrus(x) $\leftrightarrow$ (
    x \text{ is a gyral cortex region}
    \wedge x \text{ is located in the frontal lobe}
    \wedge x \text{ is anatomically defined by the boundaries of the inferior frontal gyrus}
    \wedge x \text{ occupies the specific triangular segment of that gyrus}
)

$\forall x: \text{Address}(x) \leftrightarrow (\exists \text{StreetNum}, \text{StreetName}, \text{City}, \text{State}, \text{PostalCode}: (
    \text{Component}(x, \text{StreetNum}) \land \text{Component}(\text{StreetNum}, \text{IsNumber})
) \land (
    \text{Component}(x, \text{StreetName}) \land \text{Component}(\text{StreetName}, \text{IsName})
) \land (
    \text{Component}(x, \text{City}) \land \text{Component}(\text{City}, \text{IsLocality})
) \land (
    \text{Component}(x, \text{State}) \land \text{Component}(\text{State}, \text{IsPoliticalDivision})
) \land (
    \text{Component}(x, \text{PostalCode}) \land \text{Component}(\text{PostalCode}, \text{IsAlphanumericCode})
) \land \text{FormattedAddress}(x, \text{StreetNum}, \text{StreetName}, \text{City}, \text{State}, \text{PostalCode})$

*Note: $\text{Component}(x, y)$ asserts that $y$ is a component of $x$. $\text{FormattedAddress}$ asserts that the identified components are structured according to standard addressing conventions.*

∀x: 
  naive bayes classifiers(x) 
  ∈ {x | 
    (x = classifier and 
     ∀y (y ∈ domain(x) → 
        ∃z (z ∈ parameter space(x) → 
          z is Gaussian and 
           ∃w (w ∈ parameter space(x) → 
             (w ∈ parameter space(x) → 
              (w is prior(w) ∧ 
               w is conditional(z, w))) 
          )
        )
      )
    )
  }

∀x: microprocessor chips(x) ≡ ∀y (y ∈ x → (y ∈ {CPU, digital circuit, integrates multiple components})
∀y ∈ x: 
(y ∈ {processor, processor core, processing unit, logic gate, digital circuit})
∃z ∈ x: z ∈ {transistor, semiconductor, integrated circuit}
∀z ∈ x: z ∈ {small, compact, silicon-based}
∀w ∈ x: w ∈ {electrically programmable, digitally controllable}

$\forall x$: Coumestrol($x$) $\leftrightarrow$ (
    $x$ $\land$ (
        $x$ $\approx$ (
            2,3,4,2H-chromenedione-2-one derivative
            $\land$
            (
                $x$ $\approx$ 1,2-dihydro-3-hydroxy-2-methyl-7-methoxy-chromene-2,3-dione
            )
        )
    )
)
